# ---- Project: raw video is NOT committed ----
# Source recordings are 60-280 MB each and exceed GitHub's 100 MB file limit.
# Full recordings are hosted externally and linked from each module README.
# Only extracted still frames (PNG/JPG) and short compressed clips are tracked.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
vedios/
videos/

# Exception: short compressed demo clips under 10 MB, if added deliberately
!assets/clips/*.mp4
!**/video/*_clip.mp4
!**/video/*.gif

# ---- Project: local capture output ----
captures/
snapshots/
*.log
config.local.ini

# Contact sheets are a local browsing aid (~17 MB), regenerate with tools/extract_frames.py
assets/sheets/
